    "eventDetail": "Drawing attendees from across the globe, the AANA Annual Meeting is the world's largest arthroscopy-focused event of the year. The hallmarks of the Annual Meeting are scientific podium presentations and Instructional Course Lectures that put forth the latest research, innovations, and techniques in the field. With an emphasis on no-nonsense discussion and AANA's focus on inclusiveness as the largest orthopaedic subspecialty, the Annual Meeting is the year's best opportunity for orthopaedic surgeons and advanced practitioners to get up to speed on the latest advances in arthroscopy.",
